1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Keep the decision, alternatives, and missing evidence in one place.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Add your own concern beneath an option. Your judgment stays in the loop.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Develop the thought directly on the canvas.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Explain your reasoning, name the trade-off, and record an open question.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Save the contribution and arrange the map.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Focus on one branch to explore the decision in depth.

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:02,000
A CLI update appears live. MCP tools use the same core graph operations.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:12,000
“Passed” records the decision. The quality questions remain unanswered.

9
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
MCP integration, schema validation, live updates, and 169 passing tests.
Local and single-user; validation checks structure, not truth.
